"Greater than or equal to, the field value must be greater than or equal to "
"the given value."
msgstr "大于或等于（greater than or equal），字段值必须大于或等于给定值"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:138
msgid "Less than, the field value must be less than the given value."
msgstr "小于（less than），字段值必须小于给定值"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:139
msgid ""
"Less than or equal to, the field value must be less than or equal to the "
"given value."
msgstr "小于或等于（less than or equal），字段值必须小于或等于给定值"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:140
msgid "The field value must start with the given string (case-sensitive)."
msgstr "字段值必须以给定的字符串开头（大小写敏感）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:142
msgid ""
"Case-insensitive start with, the field value must start with the given "
"string (case-insensitive)."
msgstr ""
"不区分大小写的 starts-with：字段值须以给定字符串开头（忽略大小写）不区分大小"
"写的以某个字符串开头，字段值必须以给定的字符串开头（不区分大小写）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:144
msgid "The field value must end with the given string (case-sensitive)."
msgstr "字段值必须以给定的字符串结尾（大小写敏感）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:145
msgid ""
"Case-insensitive end with, the field value must end with the given string "
"(case-insensitive)."
msgstr ""
"不区分大小写的 ends-with：字段值须以给定字符串结尾（忽略大小写）不区分大小写"
"的以某个字符串结尾，字段值必须以给定的字符串结尾（不区分大小写）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:146
msgid ""
"Within a range, the field value must be between the two given values "
"(inclusive)."
msgstr "在一个范围内，字段值必须在给定的两个值之间（包括两个端点）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:147
msgid "Filters only the date part (ignores the time part)."
msgstr "仅按日期部分过滤（忽略时间部分）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:148
msgid "Filters by year."
msgstr "按年份过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:149
msgid "Filters by ISO year (may not be the same as the Gregorian year)."
msgstr "ISO 年份（不一定与公历年份相同）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:150
msgid "Filters by month."
msgstr "按月份过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:151
msgid "Filters by day of the month."
msgstr "按日期（天）过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:152
msgid "Filters by week number of the year."
msgstr "按年份和周数过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:153
msgid "Filters by a specific day of the week (1 = Monday, 7 = Sunday)."
msgstr "按一周中的某一天过滤（1 = Monday, 7 = Sunday）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:154
msgid "Filters by a specific day of the ISO week (1 = Monday, 7 = Sunday)."
msgstr "ISO 周中的某一天（1 = Monday, 7 = Sunday）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:155
msgid "Filters by quarter (1, 2, 3, 4)."
msgstr "按季度过滤（1, 2, 3, 4）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:156
msgid "Filters only the time part (ignores the date part)."
msgstr "仅按时间部分过滤（忽略日期部分）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:157
msgid "Filters by hour."
msgstr "按小时过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:158
msgid "Filters by minute."
msgstr "按分钟过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:159
msgid "Filters by second."
msgstr "按秒过滤"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:160
msgid "Checks if the field value is NULL, can be set to True or False."
msgstr "检查字段值是否为 NULL，可以用 True 或 False"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:161
msgid ""
"The field value must match the given regular expression (case-sensitive)."
msgstr "字段值必须匹配给定的正则表达式（大小写敏感）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:162
msgid ""
"The field value must match the given regular expression (case-insensitive)."
msgstr "字段值必须匹配给定的正则表达式（不区分大小写）"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:164
msgid ""
"The field value must be a subset of the given value, typically used with "
"array or JSON fields."
msgstr "字段值必须是给定值的子集，通常用于数组或 JSON 字段"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:167
msgid ""
"The field value must contain at least one of the given keys, typically used "
"with JSON fields."
msgstr "字段值必须包含至少一个给定的键，通常用于 JSON 字段"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:169
msgid ""
"The field value must contain all the given keys, typically used with JSON "
"fields."
msgstr "字段值必须包含所有给定的键，通常用于 JSON 字段"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:170
msgid ""
"The field value must contain the given single key, typically used with JSON "
"fields."
msgstr "字段值必须包含给定的单个键，通常用于 JSON 字段"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:172
msgid "Many-to-many: the field contains any of the given values."
msgstr "多对多包含任一：关联对象中含任意一个给定值即可"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:173
msgid "Many-to-many: the field contains all of the given values."
msgstr "多对多包含全部：关联对象需含全部给定值"

#: system/utils/modelfield.py:174
msgid "IP address is inside the given network / range, * means no restriction."
msgstr "IP 属于给定网段/范围，填 * 表示不限"

